 r←testUTF8;r;req;db;con;result;data;out
⎕CS ##
⍝ Regression tests for UTF-8 bugs found during merge analysis
⍝ Bug #1: Short VARCHAR UTF-8 decoding (was monadic ⎕UCS, now 'UTF-8'⎕UCS)
⍝ Bug #2: Append string double-encoding (was <0UTF8[], now <0U1[])
:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf
req←{0::⍺,' - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message ⋄ ⍵:⍺,' - OK' ⋄ ⍺,' - FAILED'}
r←⊂'Test UTF-8 Handling'

db←open':memory:'
con←connect db

⍝ ===== Bug #1: Short VARCHAR read (≤12 bytes inline) =====
⍝ 'café' is 5 UTF-8 bytes but 4 characters — monadic ⎕UCS would give 5 chars
result←query con'SELECT ''café'' AS s'
:If 3=≢result
    data←⊃⊃1⊃result
    r,←⊂'Short UTF-8 café length'req 4=≢data
    r,←⊂'Short UTF-8 café value'req'café'≡data
:Else
    r,←⊂'Short UTF-8 query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ 2-byte sequence: ü (U+00FC)
result←query con'SELECT ''über'' AS s'
:If 3=≢result
    data←⊃⊃1⊃result
    r,←⊂'Short UTF-8 über'req'über'≡data
:Else
    r,←⊂'Short UTF-8 über query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ 3-byte sequence: 日 (U+65E5)
result←query con'SELECT ''日本'' AS s'
:If 3=≢result
    data←⊃⊃1⊃result
    r,←⊂'Short UTF-8 日本'req'日本'≡data
:Else
    r,←⊂'Short UTF-8 日本 query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ Long VARCHAR (>12 bytes, pointer-based)
result←query con'SELECT ''This is a longer café string'' AS s'
:If 3=≢result
    data←⊃⊃1⊃result
    r,←⊂'Long UTF-8 café'req'This is a longer café string'≡data
:Else
    r,←⊂'Long UTF-8 query'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== Bug #2: Append string double-encoding =====
{}query con'CREATE TABLE utf8_test(s VARCHAR)'
out←append con '' 'utf8_test' (,⊂'über' 'café' '日本語') (,type.VARCHAR)
r,←⊂'UTF-8 append succeeded'req'Success!'≡out

result←query con'SELECT * FROM utf8_test ORDER BY s'
:If 3=≢result
    data←⊃1⊃result
    r,←⊂'Append über roundtrip'req(∨/'über'∘{(≢⍺)≤≢⍵:⍺≡(≢⍺)↑⍵ ⋄ 0}¨data)
    r,←⊂'Append café roundtrip'req(∨/'café'∘{(≢⍺)≤≢⍵:⍺≡(≢⍺)↑⍵ ⋄ 0}¨data)
    r,←⊂'Append 日本語 roundtrip'req(∨/'日本語'∘{(≢⍺)≤≢⍵:⍺≡(≢⍺)↑⍵ ⋄ 0}¨data)
:Else
    r,←⊂'UTF-8 append readback'req 0
:EndIf

⍝ ===== Mixed NULL + non-ASCII =====
{}query con'CREATE TABLE utf8_null(s VARCHAR)'
out←append con '' 'utf8_null' (,⊂'hello' null 'café' null '日本') (,type.VARCHAR)
r,←⊂'UTF-8 null append succeeded'req'Success!'≡out

result←query con'SELECT * FROM utf8_null'
:If 3=≢result
    data←⊃1⊃result
    r,←⊂'Mixed null+UTF-8 count'req 5=≢data
    r,←⊂'Mixed null value 1'req null≡1⊃data
    r,←⊂'Mixed null value 3'req null≡3⊃data
:Else
    r,←⊂'UTF-8 null readback'req 0
:EndIf

disconnect con
close db
⎕←↑r

⍝ KSL 2.0.1
